usage: verify-copies-r43.py [-h] --root ROOT [--map MAP] --rev REV
                            --freeze FREEZE [--gate GATE]
                            [--pack-build PACK_BUILD]
                            [--upstream-dir UPSTREAM_DIR] [--tarball TARBALL]
                            [--tarball-650 TARBALL_650]

verify-copies-r43 — landing-time verifier for the local-sources pack (R43-C2).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           tree holding corpus/ + the map (attack clone or lane
                        after landing)
  --map MAP
  --rev REV             read SOURCES.md at this revision
  --freeze FREEZE       freeze revision of the EXPECT source
  --gate GATE
  --pack-build PACK_BUILD
                        dir holding round-42 verify-copies.py (default: inside
                        --root)
  --upstream-dir UPSTREAM_DIR
                        dir with go1.25.0/ and go1.24.6/ upstream abi trees
  --tarball TARBALL     rea-agents-6.7.0.tgz for S081
  --tarball-650 TARBALL_650
                        rea-agents-6.5.0.tgz fallback for the S048 host-
                        identity check
